about_about = FashionStoreAbout("Our Story", ["From Concrete to Catwalk","Crafting Culture, One Drop at a Time"], ["Founded in 2019 in the heart of the city’s graffiti‑filled alleys, Pulse Kicks emerged from a collective of designers, skateboarders, and sneakerheads who wanted to fuse street authenticity with premium comfort.","Our mission is simple: deliver bold, limited‑edition footwear that lets you express yourself without compromise. Every silhouette is hand‑picked, every material sourced for durability, and every release timed to keep the hype alive.","We operate on a ‘drop‑first’ philosophy—each collection is produced in limited quantities, ensuring exclusivity while reducing waste. Transparency is key: from design sketches to final stitch, we share the process with our community."], [{"value":"250+","label":"Design Hours per Drop"},{"value":"3M","label":"Feet Traveled in Testing"},{"value":"12","label":"Core Team Members"}], ["Close‑up of a handcrafted sneaker sole with bold stitching","Design team sketching new streetwear concepts","Model wearing the latest limited‑edition drop on an urban rooftop"])
